nstable node.\n\n- Since $A$ is not diagonal and has a repeated eigenvalue, there is only one linearly independent eigenvector. So, we have a degenerate node.\n\n**Note:** The phase portrait of the system looks as follows:\n\n![](images/32/32f9fd5ff34d75a7b82427a5ab7233613da3bdbaefdaef37058e65b1691b6c4a.png)" 13194139534550 17592186045417 false] [17592186166547 1074 "The matrix of our system is\n![](images/dd/dda3aceadd2c3bc3b53422d9533f3b5926906de522137d2e0edc4794d658b1fd.svg)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- Since the only (repeated) eigenvalue of $A$ is positive, we have a unstable node.\n\n- Since $A$ is not diagonal and has a repeated eigenvalue, there is only one linearly independent eigenvector. So, we have a degenerate node.\n\n**Note:** The phase portrait of the system looks as follows:\n\n![](images/32/32f9fd5ff34d75a7b82427a5ab7233613da3bdbaefdaef37058e65b1691b6c4a.png)" 13194139534550 17592186045417 true] [17592186166919 1038 #edb/ref 17592186425335 13194139534550 17592186045417 true] [17592186166919 1038 #edb/ref 17592186425336 13194139534550 17592186045417 true] [17592186166920 1038 #edb/ref 17592186425337 13194139534550 17592186045417 true] [17592186166921 1038 #edb/ref 17592186425334 13194139534550 17592186045417 true] [17592186166921 1038 #edb/ref 17592186425338 13194139534550 17592186045417 true] [17592186167011 1050 600.0 13194139534550 17592186045417 true] [17592186167237 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534550 17592186045417 true] [17592186167237 1071 "$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t)=5x(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t)=5y(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following could represent the phase portrait of the decoupled system above?" 13194139534550 17592186045417 true] [17592186167237 1071 "${x^{′}(t) = 5x(t); y^{′}(t) = 5y(t)$\nWhich of the following could represent the phase portrait of the decoupled system above?" 13194139534550 17592186045417 false] [17592186167237 1074 "Writing our system in matrix form, we have\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 \\\\ 0 